Cl(2,4) with generators e0 (+1), e1, e2, e3 (-1), e+ (+1), e- (-1); n0 = (e+ + e-)/2, ninf = e+ - e-;
frozen point I = ninf + (Lambda/6) n0, canonical tractor X = n0, Stelle-West vector V = X - (3/Lambda) I.
