    # = -shell pi^2 <d_a delta, g>, and mu d/dmu <[w_nu w_a/s^3]_mu, g> = +shell pi^2 delta_(a nu) g(0).
    # With Sigma = c_s xi e^2 pi^-4 w/s^3 and the zero-transfer vertex c_s xi e^2 pi^-4 w_nu w/s^3, c_s = -1/4:
